== History ==
2026
* Hero Ice Golem was added to the game on 5/1/2026 with the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/1/2026)|January 2026 Update]], along with [[Wizard/Hero|Hero Wizard]]{{Balance|Add}}.
* On 2/3/2026, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/3/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased Freeze duration to 1.5sec (from 2sec){{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 7/4/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2026)|Balance Update]], the pushback on the Hero Ice Golem was removed entirely{{Balance|Remove}}.
* On 4/8/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2026)|Balance Update]], the 3rd Blast Effect went from being a freeze effect to a slowdown effect{{Balance|Remove}}, and the blast damage was increased by 82%{{Balance|Buff}}. This also made the ability single use (from 17 sec cooldown){{Balance|Remove}}.

